  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Nutrifruit",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 49,
          "w": 262,
          "h": 24,
          "text": "Nutrifruit: Suppression Log",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "营养果：压制记录"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 240,
          "text": "Pastel's seed division found that the Nutrifruit strain could feed three times as many people per harvest. Instead of releasing it, the board ordered the strain suppressed. A controlled food supply is a controlled population.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "帕斯特种子部门发现，营养果每季产量足以养活三倍的人口。董事会没有公开，而是下令封存该品系。控制食物，就是控制人口。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "wrap": true,
          "autoHeight": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 340,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 25,
          "text": "Filed under: agricultural security. Access: director level.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "归档类别：农业安全。访问权限：董事级。"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "wrap": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "The Frame-Up",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 49,
          "w": 262,
          "h": 24,
          "text": "The Frame-Up",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "伪造的罪名"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 240,
          "text": "The embezzlement records were fabricated from three shell accounts. The signature on the transfer order belongs to a director who has never set foot in the hydroponics farm. My mother's name was added last.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "贪污记录由三个空壳账户拼接而成。转账令上的签名属于一位从未踏进水培农场的董事。我母亲的名字，是最后才被加进去的。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "wrap": true,
          "autoHeight": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 340,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 25,
          "text": "The drive contains the raw ledger. Pastel needs it back before the next supply review.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "U盘里是原始账本。帕斯特必须在下次配给审查前把它拿回去。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "wrap": true,
          "autoHeight": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A Note",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 49,
          "w": 262,
          "h": 24,
          "text": "A Note from Her Mother",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "母亲留下的便条"
          },
          "style": "title",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 200,
          "text": "Eleanor, if you are reading this, I am sorry I taught you to be proud instead of careful. Find someone who knows how to keep a secret, and hold on to them. The station is colder than it looks. — Mom",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "埃莉诺，如果你读到这些，我很抱歉教会你骄傲，却没教会你小心。去找一个懂得保守秘密的人，然后抓紧他。这个空间站，比你看到的更冷。——妈妈"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "wrap": true,
          "autoHeight": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 36,
          "y": 320,
          "w": 246,
          "h": 40,
          "text": "A copy of the drive's notes. Keep it somewhere no one else can reach.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "U盘资料的副本。放在别人够不到的地方。"
          },
          "style": "caption",
          "wrap": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
